{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-news-post-js","path":"/news/2026-11-17.DMRN2026/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p><b>DMRN+21: Digital Music Research Network 1-Day Workshop 2026</b></p>\n<p><b>King’s College London (in person only)</b><br>\n<b>Friday 11 December 2026</b><br>\n<b><a href=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/dmrn/dmrn21/\"><a href=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/dmrn/dmrn21/\">https://www.qmul.ac.uk/dmrn/dmrn21/</a></a></b></p>\n<p>The 2026 Digital Music Research Network workshop (DMRN+21) marks the 21st edition of DMRN. This event is hosted at KCL in collaboration with C4DM. Registration is <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.co.uk/e/dmrn21-digital-music-research-network-one-day-workshop-2026-tickets-2003816761876?aff=oddtdtcreator\">open for the day event</a>.</p>\n<p>For further information, visit: <a href=\"https://www.qmul.ac.uk/dmrn/dmrn21/\">https://www.qmul.ac.uk/dmrn/dmrn21/</a></p>\n<p>Enquiries: Alvaro Bort (<a href=\"mailto:a.bort@qmul.ac.uk\">a.bort@qmul.ac.uk</a>)</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"DMRN+21: Digital Music Research Network One-day Workshop 2026","date":"Monday, 17 November 2025","author":"Admin","image":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#e8e8f8","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/6a96619ca934bdc4aee6bdedb3d8a3e9/c8c99/DMRN-logo.jpg","srcSet":"/static/6a96619ca934bdc4aee6bdedb3d8a3e9/01227/DMRN-logo.jpg 200w,\n/static/6a96619ca934bdc4aee6bdedb3d8a3e9/3fb31/DMRN-logo.jpg 400w,\n/static/6a96619ca934bdc4aee6bdedb3d8a3e9/c8c99/DMRN-logo.jpg 800w","sizes":"(min-width: 800px) 800px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/6a96619ca934bdc4aee6bdedb3d8a3e9/368e3/DMRN-logo.webp 200w,\n/static/6a96619ca934bdc4aee6bdedb3d8a3e9/3e8e4/DMRN-logo.webp 400w,\n/static/6a96619ca934bdc4aee6bdedb3d8a3e9/9a75b/DMRN-logo.webp 800w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 800px) 800px, 100vw"}]},"width":800,"height":204}}}}}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/news/2026-11-17.DMRN2026","breadcrumb":{"locati